      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nPeriod for sitting and completing the test\n\n(5A) A determination under subsection (1) may provide for the period\nwithin which a person must start the test and for the period within\nwhich a person must complete the test.",
