    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 Subsection 46(1A)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\nAmendments relating to citizenship test review etc.  Schedule 1\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Test Review and Other Measures) Act 2009\nNo. 90, 2009            5\n\n(1A) For applications made under section 21 by persons who, in order to\nbe eligible to become an Australian citizen under subsection 21(2),\nmust have sat a test approved in a determination under\nsection 23A, the fee prescribed by the regulations may include a\ncomponent that relates to the sitting of that test.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\nAmendments relating to citizenship test review etc.  Schedule 1\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Test Review and Other Measures) Act 2009\nNo. 90, 2009            5\n\n(1A) For applications made under section 21 by persons who, in order to\nbe eligible to become an Australian citizen under subsection 21(2),\nmust have sat a test approved in a determination under\nsection 23A, the fee prescribed by the regulations may include a\ncomponent that relates to the sitting of that test.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ee1fd5897197e627a756fb1029b53eb4ce4d24ad4cad60f3b3404e0c9624bf6c",
      "skos:note": "Fee for test sitting may include a component related to the test."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Subsection 46(1A)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\nAmendments relating to citizenship test review etc.  Schedule 1\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Test Review and Other Measures) Act 2009\nNo. 90, 2009            5\n\n(1A) For applications made under section 21 by persons who, in order to\nbe eligible to become an Australian citizen under subsection 21(2),\nmust have sat a test approved in a determination under\nsection 23A, the fee prescribed by the regulations may include a\ncomponent that relates to the sitting of that test."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-8"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-8-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Fee includes a component related to the test.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 Application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by items 2, 3, 5, 7 and 8 apply in relation to\napplications made on or after the commencement of those items.\n(2)\nHowever, the amendment made by item 2 does not apply in relation to a\nperson if:\n\n(a) the person makes an application on or after that\ncommencement; and\n\n(b) the Minister is satisfied that the person had, before that\ncommencement, sat a test approved in a determination under\nsection 23A of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 and\nsuccessfully completed that test (worked out in accordance\nwith that determination).\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments relating to special residence requirement",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments made by items 2, 3, 5, 7 and 8 apply in relation to\napplications made on or after the commencement of those items.\n(2)\nHowever, the amendment made by item 2 does not apply in relation to a\nperson if:\n\n(a) the person makes an application on or after that\ncommencement; and\n\n(b) the Minister is satisfied that the person had, before that\ncommencement, sat a test approved in a determination under\nsection 23A of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 and\nsuccessfully completed that test (worked out in accordance\nwith that determination).\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments relating to special residence requirement",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-9-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "79160cf954860c3ec2c361bf58370a88463144669df5f47ce7e7c736e3def87a",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement for certain amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 Application",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by items 2, 3, 5, 7 and 8 apply in relation to\napplications made on or after the commencement of those items.\n(2)\nHowever, the amendment made by item 2 does not apply in relation to a\nperson if:\n\n(a) the person makes an application on or after that\ncommencement; and\n\n(b) the Minister is satisfied that the person had, before that\ncommencement, sat a test approved in a determination under\nsection 23A of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 and\nsuccessfully completed that test (worked out in accordance\nwith that determination).\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments relating to special residence requirement"
    },
