    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-2-sec-22b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22B(2) Special residence requirement—persons engaged in particular",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to subsection (3), the person is taken not to satisfy\nparagraph (1)(c) if, at any time during the 4 year period mentioned\nin that paragraph, the person was:\n\n(a) confined in a prison; or\n\n(b) confined in a psychiatric institution by order of a court made\nin connection with proceedings for an offence against an\nAustralian law in relation to the person."
    },
