      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to\napplications made on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nSenate on 25 June 2009\nHouse of Representatives on 16 September 2009]\n\n(132/09)\n\n\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Test Review and Other Measures) Act 2009\nNo. 90, 2009            11",
